            "notes": "### For your first rounds you wanna focus on healing fast and efficiently that's why we focus on [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) , [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)\n\n---\n\n# Power :\n\n  [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) \n* perfect to make early money\n\n---\n\n\n## Items :\n\n\ud83d\udc8a   [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) \n* (\u2695\ufe0f10 ) gain 50 OverHealth\n\n\ud83e\udd8a [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) \n* (\u26a110 %)  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) will buff your clone\n\n\u2694\ufe0f [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n* ( \u23ea 5% ) to more efficient heal\n\n---\n\n usual Kiri play Style :\n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n\n---\n\nFor survivability :\n\n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)",
