            "notes": "## Now you should be able to get your ultimate 2-3 + times per round\n\n---\n\n# Power :\n\n [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) \n* Will give you 5 % Ultimate charge each time you cleanse an ally this mean if you cleanse your whole team  with [Protection Suzu](ability_e0d6579f-d70a-4a5e-a58d-aee40d00c568)( you included ) you will gain 25 % ult charge this make it really op against [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) / [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1)  check the \"Optional Tab\" if they are against you \n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udff0 Items : \n\n\ud83d\udc8a  [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718)\n* (\u26a120 % )  to give extra health each time you suzu your teammate perfect for faster regen / give them an advantage for a fight\n\n\ud83e\udd8a  [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \n* (\u26a110 % )\n\n\ud83e\udd8a [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) \n* (\u26a120 % )\n\n\ud83e\udd8a  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) \n* (\u26a110 % , \u23f1\ufe0f 5 % )\n\n\ud83e\udd8a   [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) \n* (  \u26a110 % ) while below 50 % Health you gain 15 %  [Ability Lifesteal](stat_ability_lifesteal) \n\n\n---\n\n\n## Optional :\n\ud83d\udc8a [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)\n* ( 5% , \u2695\ufe0f 50 ) will pair with [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) each time you use [Swift Step](ability_7f6c99f6-7a6f-4f67-a8fd-d6bf6a09e014) you wil cleanse yourself i recommend to use it against [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) / [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) \n\n` Thank you @Temperr in the comments for the info !  `\n---\n\n\nif you have more money refer to [Know your Play Style](##heading-ids)",
