            "notes": "## Your health / cd  should be more than enough now to make you resist most of the fight / contest a point while your team is respawning and be able to spam your ult very often\n _________________________________________\n# Power :\n\nThere is no real power that is a go too look at the notes next to each power and pick the one that fits the most your situation\n\n [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663) \n* If you lack of health it will heal 3% of your Ofuda healing capacities everytime you heal someone\n\n [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) \n* to keep boosting your teammates by 20 % [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)  while healing them\n\n [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f) \n* take it if you feel like you will not die often , it will basically turn your enemies affected by your ultimate to practice target\n _________________________________________\n## \ud83d\udff0 Items :\n\n\ud83e\udd8a  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) \n* (\u26a135 %)\n\n\ud83d\udc8a [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) \n* (\u26a120 % ) \n\n\ud83e\udd8a [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \n*  (\u23f1\ufe0f 10 % )\n\n\ud83e\udd8a [Our Bikes](item_d9fa8542-237e-49d5-b6a1-4e910d5c777f) \n* ( \u26a115 % , \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 25 health) will passively heal your ally for 80 [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)  each second\n \n \ud83e\udd8a [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) \n* (\u26a110% ,\u23f1\ufe0f 5% )\n\n\ud83e\udd8a  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) \n* (\u26a120 % )\n _________________________________________\n### Optional :\n\n\ud83d\udc8a [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)\n* ( 5% , \u2695\ufe0f 50 ) refer to R5 for more info\n \n____\nif you have more money refer to [Know your Play Style](##heading-ids)",
